@model IndexModel
@{
    var zh = Model.IsChinese;
}
<header class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">@(zh ? "靜心祈禱" : "A QUIET PLACE TO PRAY")</span><h1>@(zh ? "關於 Veritas" : "About Veritas")</h1><p>@(zh ? "留一處空間，停下、祈禱，重新回到重要的事。" : "A little space to pause, pray, and return to what matters.")</p></div><span class="heading-mark">✳</span></header>
<section class="about-hero"><span class="about-emblem" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">FAITH · HOPE · LOVE</span><h2>@(zh ? "讓心靈安靜下來。" : "Make room for stillness.")</h2><p>@(zh ? "Veritas 是陪伴你天主教祈禱生活的一位寧靜夥伴。你可以與每日默想一同停留，在祈禱文庫中尋找熟悉的字句，或按自己的步伐誦念玫瑰經。" : "Veritas is a quiet companion for your Catholic prayer life. Take a moment with a daily reflection, find familiar words in the prayer library, or follow a guided Rosary at your own pace.")</p></div></section>
<section class="values-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>@(zh ? "每日片刻" : "A moment each day")</h3><p>@(zh ? "每日默想邀請你放慢腳步，以整個自己來到天主面前。" : "Daily reflections invite you to slow down and bring your whole self to prayer.")</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>@(zh ? "熟悉的祈禱詞" : "Words to return to")</h3><p>@(zh ? "以英文、拉丁文及繁體中文，重拾教會珍貴的傳統祈禱。" : "Explore traditional prayers in English, Latin, and Traditional Chinese.")</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>@(zh ? "按自己的步伐" : "Pray at your own pace")</h3><p>@(zh ? "循序默想玫瑰經的奧蹟，不必匆忙。" : "Follow the mysteries of the Rosary one gentle step at a time.")</p></article></section>
<section class="about-story"><span class="eyebrow">@(zh ? "創作者的話" : "THE PERSON BEHIND VERITAS")</span><h2>@(zh ? "關於我" : "About me")</h2><p>@(zh ? "我名叫潘龍熙（Chavez Cyrillus Mariae Long Hei Poon），是一位居於英格蘭的傳統羅馬天主教平信徒輔祭、禮儀總監、自由撰稿人及天主教數碼內容創作者。我在香港出生及受教育，服務教會逾十年，曾任輔祭、聖器員及禮儀總監。這段服務加深了我對神聖禮儀、教會歷史及羅馬天主教靈修傳統的欣賞。" : "My name is Chavez Cyrillus Mariae Long Hei Poon. I am a Traditionalist Roman Catholic lay Acolyte, Liturgical Master of Ceremonies, freelance writer, and Catholic digital content creator based in England. Born and educated in Hong Kong, I have served the Church for more than a decade as an Acolyte, Sacristan, and Liturgical Master of Ceremonies. This service has deepened my appreciation for the Sacred Liturgy, ecclesiastical history, and the spiritual heritage of the Roman Catholic Church.")</p><p>@(zh ? "我把資訊科技的背景與對教會的承諾結合，投入網站開發、天主教傳訊及數碼項目。Veritas 是我最新的計劃，旨在讓傳統及當代祈禱資源更易接觸，並鼓勵每日祈禱、默想及與天主建立更深的關係。" : "I combine my background in information technology with my commitment to the Church through website development, Catholic communications, and digital projects. Veritas is my latest initiative: a prayer website intended to make traditional and contemporary devotional resources more accessible and to encourage daily prayer, reflection, and a deeper relationship with God.")</p><p>@(zh ? "我亦創立 Lumen Orientale，撰寫有關天主教禮儀、教會歷史及教會發展的文章。我期望透過寫作與數碼出版，使教會傳統更易理解，並忠於教會訓導及與聖座的共融。" : "I am also the founder of Lumen Orientale, where I write about Catholic liturgy, ecclesiastical history, and developments in the Church. Through writing and digital publishing, I hope to make the Church’s traditions better understood while remaining faithful to her teachings and communion with the Holy See.")</p><p class="motto"><em>Ad maiorem Dei gloriam</em> — @(zh ? "愈顯主榮" : "For the greater glory of God.")</p></section>
<aside class="closing-note"><span>✧</span><p>@(zh ? "「你們要安靜，要知道我是天主。」" : "“Be still, and let your heart listen.”")</p><small>AD MAIOREM DEI GLORIAM</small></aside>
